    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the pressure to \"fix\" it is the problem though. it never gets fixed. no matter how many times i restart, i just end up back in the same dark place. it feels like it's just some fundamental flaw in me. like i'm broken and there's no point in trying to patch something that's just destined to fail. it's just endless pain.",
