      "content": "That feeling of being fundamentally broken and destined to fail is an incredibly painful trap many people fall into when they feel stuck in cycles. However, repeating a negative outcome doesn't mean a fundamental flaw exists; it often means we haven't yet found the specific support or strategy that fits our unique situation. Giving yourself grace to feel this grief and pain without demanding an immediate fix is the first, hardest step toward being kind to yourself during this long process.",
